        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>•</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlDetectedTouchBinormal" target="_blank">llDetectedTouchBinormal</a></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>Notes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Is treated like <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a> in <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Conditional" target="_blank">conditionals</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <p>Has the same value as <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ZERO_VECTOR" target="_blank">ZERO_VECTOR</a>.</p>
  <p>History</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Introduced in <a href="http://svn.secondlife.com/trac/linden/changeset/1167?new_path=%2F#file24" target="_blank">SVN:1167 r96080 Branch:viewer_1-21-2&amp;#32;Tuesday, 09 September 2008</a></li>
    <li>Merged into Trunk <a href="http://svn.secondlife.com/trac/linden/changeset/1169?new_path=%2F#file24" target="_blank">SVN:1169 r96492 Trunk&amp;#32;Thursday, 11 September 2008</a></li>
  </ul>
